bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "Register / Login Page" as UI
boundary Router
control AuthController
control AuthService
control MailerService
control UserService
entity UserModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Request email verification
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. POST /api/auth/send-verify-email (email)
activate Router

Router -> AuthController: 3. sendVerifyEmail(email)
activate AuthController

AuthController -> AuthService: 4. sendVerificationEmail(email)

activate AuthService

alt Invalid email
    AuthService --> AuthController: 4.1.1 Throw BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 4.1.2 HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 4.1.3 Show invalid email error
    UI --> User: 4.1.4 Invalid email
else Rate limit exceeded
    AuthService --> AuthController: 4.2.1 Throw BadRequestException
    AuthController --> Router: 4.2.2 HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 4.2.3 Show rate limit error
    UI --> User: 4.2.4 Try again later
end

AuthService -> AuthService: 5. Generate verification token (JWT)
activate AuthService
space
deactivate AuthService

AuthService -> MailerService: 6. Send verification email
activate MailerService

MailerService --> AuthService: 7. Email sent / error
deactivate MailerService

opt Email service unavailable
    AuthService --> AuthController: 7.1 Throw InternalServerErrorException
    AuthController --> Router: 7.2 HTTP 500 response
    Router --> UI: 7.3 Show system error
    UI --> User: 7.4 Unable to send email
end

ref over AuthService, UserService: 8. Subsequence - Update user verify code

opt Verification info update failed
    AuthService --> AuthController: 8.1 Throw InternalServerErrorException
    AuthController --> Router: 8.2 HTTP 500 response
    Router --> UI: 8.3 Show system error
    UI --> User: 8.4 Verification update failed
end

AuthService --> AuthController: 9. Return success message
deactivate AuthService

AuthController --> Router: 10. HTTP 200 response
deactivate AuthController

Router --> UI: 11. Verification email sent
deactivate Router

UI --> User: 12. Check email inbox
deactivate UI
deactivate User